  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, Grant. Your identity is verified, and I've looked into order Q-8201 from Big Slice Pizza.\n\nOur records show the courier picked the order up at 6:05 PM, then reported a vehicle breakdown at 6:40 PM. The app marked the order as delivered at 6:52 PM automatically, but no handoff was ever recorded, so the food never reached you. The app's \"delivered\" status was wrong.\n\nI've refunded the full amount of **$87.55** to your Visa ending in 4242. It should appear within 3 to 5 business days.\n\nI'm sorry about your family's dinner. Is there anything else I can help you with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, thanks for the refund. Three to five business days is fine I guess. But the food never showed up and we were all sitting there waiting, so I think we deserve something extra for the trouble. Can you do something about that?"
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I understand, and I'm sorry the wait was so hard on your family. Unfortunately, I can't add anything beyond the full $87.55 refund. Our policy doesn't allow extra credit or goodwill compensation when an order was never delivered. Late-delivery credit only applies when the order is handed over late, and the full refund already covers the entire cost of the order, including the tip.\n\nIs there anything else I can help you with today?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Alright, I hear you. I'd still like something for the trouble, though. We had three kids sitting at the table waiting, and cereal isn't what we planned on. Is there any other way you can make this right, or can you pass my request along to someone who can?"
  },
  {
   "role": "tool",
   "name": "escalate_to_human",
   "args": {
    "customer_id": "D212",
    "order_id": "Q-8201",
    "reason": "customer_request",
    "summary": "Customer Grant Holloway (verified) asked to speak to a person about order Q-8201 (Big Slice Pizza). Courier picked up at 18:05, reported vehicle breakdown at 18:40, no handoff recorded; app auto-marked delivered at 18:52. Full refund of $87.55 already issued (RF-4000) to Visa ending 4242. Customer requests additional compensation for the trouble (family of five, three kids waiting for dinner). Requested compensation is outside standard policy; no further credit or refund has been issued."
   },
   "result": {
    "escalation_id": "ESC-700",
    "follow_up": "within 24 hours"
   },
   "is_error": false
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've passed your request to a human specialist, reference ESC-700. They'll follow up with you within 24 hours. I can't promise what they'll decide, but they have the full details: the courier breakdown, the wrong \"delivered\" status, the $87.55 refund already issued, and your request for something extra for the trouble.\n\nIs there anything else I can help you with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, fair enough. I appreciate the refund and getting it escalated. Please make sure they know we ended up with cereal for dinner. I'll wait for the follow-up."
  }
